ess_or_residence_district"}], "intentions": [], "compositions": [], "residues": [{"span": "a4", "why": "The duty is the same whether or not a person is with the vehicle: the words say so expressly.", "scope": "none"}], "binders": [{"name": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}], "applicability": "The subject is a vehicle. Engaged at an observation where the subject occupies an st.highway region, the reading does not declare asm.business_or_residence_district for its place (declared false), the subject occupies an st.roadway region, and an st.shoulder or st.parking_space region lies on the same highway (st.on_way) within ground distance (st.region_geometry) p.offroad_refuge_reach of the subject's body. Not engaged where the subject is disabled so that it is impossible to avoid stopping (gap).", "obligation": "drv.motion.complete_halt(subject; p.halt_speed_tolerance) does not hold: the subject is not at rest on the roadway. A halt there is violated.", "params": ["p.halt_speed_tolerance", "p.offroad_refuge_reach"], "narrowings": [{"span": "a3", "why": "'no person shall stop, park or leave standing' is read through the vehicle's conduct, whoever controls it.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "a6", "why": "'practicable' is read as the presence of a shoulder or bay on the same way within the reach; whether that place is occupied or wide enough is not read.", "kind": "reading"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "District declared false; the subject car halts in the roadway lane of a rural highway for 60 s while a paved shoulder lies on the same way 2 m from its body."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "District declared false; the subject car drives along the roadway beside the shoulder at 20 m/s without halting."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "asm.business_or_residence_district declared true for the subject's place