{"node_id": "NRS_484B_410_o2", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-410"], "subject": {"binder": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "A person,", "role": "subject"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "except when stopping, standing or parking where no parking is permitted,", "role": "exception"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "shall not start a vehicle which is stopped, standing or parked on a highway", "role": "sibling"}, {"id": "s4", "text": "nor enter upon a highway", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s5", "text": "unless and until such movement can be made with safety.", "role": "standard"}], "elements": [{"span": "s1", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"], "derived": [], "justification": "'A person' who enters upon a highway with a vehicle is read through the vehicle's controlled motion (agency reading): the binder is the vehicle, the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle; same mapping as the index row 'A person'."}, {"span": "s2", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.curb_zone", "dev.regulatory_sign", "dev.governs", "st.travel_region", "prim.conditions_hold"], "derived": ["drv.motion.complete_halt"], "justification": "'stopping, standing or parking' (DEF-NRS-484A-260 'any halting, even momentarily, of a vehicle'; DEF-NRS-484A-250 'the halting of a vehicle'; DEF-NRS-484A-155 'the standing of a vehicle') together denote every halt, drv.motion.complete_halt, read at the observation before the entry. 'where no parking is permitted': an st.curb_zone of kind no_parking, no_stopping or fire_lane or a curb painted red that the footprint overlaps (rel.occupies), or an st.travel_region it occupies governed (dev.governs) by a dev.regulatory_sign of code no_parking, no_standing or no_stopping whose conditions hold (prim.conditions_hold); the posted or painted feature is the evidence (status reading)."}, {"span": "s4", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.highway"], "derived": [], "justification": "'enter upon a highway' is the 